<title>LATVIA: Latvian capital Riga says has BBB- S&amp;P rating.</title>
<headline>Latvian capital Riga says has BBB- S&amp;P rating.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Latvian capital Riga said on Monday that it has been awarded a BBB- long-term credit rating by Standard &amp; Poor's but was seeking a higher rating.</p>
<p>Riga city finance department deputy director Inga Cerbule told Reuters that Riga was awarded the rating in January but has not made it public because it was not satisfied with it.</p>
</text>
